# What the container images may be built from: only what's named here goes to the builder, so nothing else, as
# private/ (the real house) or data/ (readings and sign-ins), can end up in an image, whatever a Containerfile copies.
# Docker and Podman both read this file.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!web.go
!cloud/
!housemon/
**/__pycache__
